DSHMap.receive("pkg","@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-session-titles-bundle",{"readme":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-session-titles-bundle\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n## Summary\n\nGenerate experimental session titles from the conversation's eligible human prompts. This replaces the first-prompt title provider and applies across presets. It ships switched off in Web and Desktop. Select it in Plugins to enable it.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Use this package](#use-this-package)\n- [Understand the implementation](#understand-the-implementation)\n- [Further Exploration](#further-exploration)\n- [Model Experience](#model-experience)\n- [Known Limitations and Deferred Work](#known-limitations-and-deferred-work)\n- [Dev Note](#dev-note)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"use-this-package\"></a>\n## Use this package\n\nIn Web or Desktop, open Plugins and enable **Conversation-following titles** in Official. Switch it off to remove its profile layer.\n\nThe switch changes the title provider for existing and new Sessions. Eligible human prompts or explicit refresh trigger title requests; the model is asked to keep an existing generated title exactly while it still describes the main topic or task. Automatic updates preserve user-pinned titles. Agent tool catalogs remain unchanged.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"understand-the-implementation\"></a>\n## Understand the implementation\n\n<details>\n<summary>Implementation details — click to expand</summary>\n\n[`cordis.patch.yml`](cordis.patch.yml) contributes the provider on the host. Later profile patches can override its settings. The [profile composer](../../boot/app-boot/README.md) owns patch ordering and errors. The layer disables `session-title-llm` before selecting its replacement; deselection restores the default provider.\n\n</details>\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"further-exploration\"></a>\n## Further Exploration\n\n[Capability implementation](../session-title-all-prompts-llm/README.md)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"model-experience\"></a>\n## Model Experience\n\nIndirectly, through the [capability implementation](../session-title-all-prompts-llm/README.md), which owns model context and results.\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nThe layer adds no request content directly; the capability implementation owns cache effects from tools, prompts, and results.\n\n## Known Limitations and Deferred Work\n\n<a id=\"known-limitations-and-deferred-work\"></a>\n\n- Automatic title failures retain the previous title. The 4096-byte title-input budget includes the current generated title when supplied and rejects oversized input instead of truncating conversation history.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"dev-note\"></a>\n### Dev Note\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer context — click to expand</summary>\n\nNone.\n\n</details>\n","modelExperience":"Indirectly, through the [capability implementation](../session-title-all-prompts-llm/README.md), which owns model context and results.\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nThe layer adds no request content directly; the capability implementation owns cache effects from tools, prompts, and results.","limitations":"- Automatic title failures retain the previous title. The 4096-byte title-input budget includes the current generated title when supplied and rejects oversized input instead of truncating conversation history.\n\n-----","files":[["README.i18n.yaml",37,1616,"o"],["README.md",78,2690,"o"],["README.zh.md",78,2439,"o"],["cordis.patch.yml",12,308,"o"],["icon.svg",11,731,"o"],["locale/en.json",6,139,"o"],["locale/zh.json",6,134,"o"],["package.json",49,1215,"o"],["src/index.ts",2,112,"s"],["tsconfig.json",15,227,"o"]],"sources":{"README.md":"---\ndescription: \"Refresh session titles as new human prompts arrive.\"\nkind: \"package-bundle\"\n---\n\n# @deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-session-titles-bundle\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n## Summary\n\nGenerate experimental session titles from the conversation's eligible human prompts. This replaces the first-prompt title provider and applies across presets. It ships switched off in Web and Desktop. Select it in Plugins to enable it.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Use this package](#use-this-package)\n- [Understand the implementation](#understand-the-implementation)\n- [Further Exploration](#further-exploration)\n- [Model Experience](#model-experience)\n- [Known Limitations and Deferred Work](#known-limitations-and-deferred-work)\n- [Dev Note](#dev-note)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"use-this-package\"></a>\n## Use this package\n\nIn Web or Desktop, open Plugins and enable **Conversation-following titles** in Official. Switch it off to remove its profile layer.\n\nThe switch changes the title provider for existing and new Sessions. Eligible human prompts or explicit refresh trigger title requests; the model is asked to keep an existing generated title exactly while it still describes the main topic or task. Automatic updates preserve user-pinned titles. Agent tool catalogs remain unchanged.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"understand-the-implementation\"></a>\n## Understand the implementation\n\n<details>\n<summary>Implementation details — click to expand</summary>\n\n[`cordis.patch.yml`](cordis.patch.yml) contributes the provider on the host. Later profile patches can override its settings. The [profile composer](../../boot/app-boot/README.md) owns patch ordering and errors. The layer disables `session-title-llm` before selecting its replacement; deselection restores the default provider.\n\n</details>\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"further-exploration\"></a>\n## Further Exploration\n\n[Capability implementation](../session-title-all-prompts-llm/README.md)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"model-experience\"></a>\n## Model Experience\n\nIndirectly, through the [capability implementation](../session-title-all-prompts-llm/README.md), which owns model context and results.\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nThe layer adds no request content directly; the capability implementation owns cache effects from tools, prompts, and results.\n\n## Known Limitations and Deferred Work\n\n<a id=\"known-limitations-and-deferred-work\"></a>\n\n- Automatic title failures retain the previous title. The 4096-byte title-input budget includes the current generated title when supplied and rejects oversized input instead of truncating conversation history.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"dev-note\"></a>\n### Dev Note\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer context — click to expand</summary>\n\nNone.\n\n</details>\n","cordis.patch.yml":"- id: session-title-llm\n  disabled: true\n\n- insert:\n    - id: optional-session-title-all-prompts\n      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-session-title-all-prompts-llm'\n      config:\n        targetWords: 5\n        targetCjkCharacters: 10\n        maxInputBytes: 4096\n        maxOutputTokens: 64\n        timeoutMs: 60000\n","icon.svg":"<svg width=\"36\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect x=\"11.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2.5\" fill=\"#7CB7FF\" fill-opacity=\"0.55\" />\n  <path d=\"M10 12H23C24.3807 12 25.5 13.1193 25.5 14.5V23.5C25.5 24.8807 24.3807 26 23 26H14.5L10.4 30.1Q10 30.5 10 29.93V26C8.61929 26 7.5 24.8807 7.5 23.5V14.5C7.5 13.1193 8.61929 12 10 12Z\" fill=\"url(#session-title-bubble)\" />\n  <path d=\"M13 16H20M16.5 16V22\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" />\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"session-title-bubble\" x1=\"9\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"28\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#6FB2EE\" />\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#3E58D6\" />\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n</svg>\n","locale/en.json":"{\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"title\": \"Conversation-following titles\",\n    \"description\": \"Refresh session titles as new human prompts arrive.\"\n  }\n}\n","locale/zh.json":"{\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"title\": \"随对话更新的标题\",\n    \"description\": \"在收到新的用户提示时更新会话标题。\"\n  }\n}\n","package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-session-titles-bundle\",\n  \"description\": \"Refresh session titles as new human prompts arrive.\",\n  \"version\": \"0.2.1-rc.2\",\n  \"icon\": \"./icon.svg\",\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    \"access\": \"public\"\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.git\",\n    \"directory\": \"packages/experimental/session-titles-bundle\"\n  },\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"lib/types/index.d.ts\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"types\": \"./lib/types/index.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./lib/index.js\"\n    },\n    \"./cordis.patch.yml\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"./locale/*.json\": \"./locale/*.json\",\n    \"./src/*\": \"./src/*\",\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"icon.svg\",\n    \"locale/*.json\",\n    \"lib/index.js\",\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"lib/types/**/*.d.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"dsh\": {\n    \"bundle\": {\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-session-title-all-prompts-llm\": \"workspace:*\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"workspace:~\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"workspace:~\"\n  }\n}\n","src/index.ts":"/** Conversation-following titles profile layer; runtime entries are declared in cordis.patch.yml. */\nexport {}\n","tsconfig.json":"{\n  \"extends\": \"../../../tsconfig.base.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"rootDir\": \"src\",\n    \"outDir\": \"lib/types\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\n    \"src\"\n  ],\n  \"references\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"../../../vendor/cordis\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"symbols":{"defs":[],"files":{},"api":[],"uses":{}}});
